sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant C as Client
    participant R as Frontend / PrefillRouter
    participant P as Prefill backend / engine
    participant D as Decode backend / engine
    C->>R: Logical generation request
    R->>P: Prefill request (internal token limit)
    P->>P: Compute context KV
    P-->>R: Prefill result + handoff parameters
    R->>R: Drain tail and propagate any error
    alt Prefill already terminal
        R-->>C: Terminal output (no Decode dispatch)
    else Nonterminal handoff
        R->>D: prefill_result + worker link; restore max_tokens
        D->>P: Connector-specific KV coordination / transfer
        Note over P,D: KV tensors bypass Frontend
        D-->>R: Generated tokens / terminal
        R-->>C: Streamed output
    end
